OL,3,ASecond catch attempt for SpaceX
OL,4,AStarship rocket
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpaceX will decide later whether to try
OL,7,Fto catch the top part of its huge
OL,8,FStarship rocket as it returns to Earth.
OL,10,FThe company had hoped to catch both the
OL,11,Fbottom and upper stages of the rocket
OL,12,Fusing mechanical arms - nicknamed
OL,13,Fchopsticks - on its launch tower.
OL,15,FBut the first catch of the rocket's
OL,16,Fbooster was aborted a few minutes after
OL,17,Fthe launch, and instead the booster
OL,18,Fdiverted to the ocean, bursting into
OL,19,Fflames just above the sea.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
