OL,3,ASecond catch attempt for SpaceX
OL,4,AStarship rocket
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe top part, known as the Ship, is due
OL,7,Fto return to Earth at about 15:15 local
OL,8,Ftime (21:15 GMT) on Saturday.
